{"id": "t097-004", "text": "Mariam and her husband are moving to Leeds early March, he got a transfer with work. She's gutted to leave the allotment, she's had it eleven years. They're renting first and then buying, probably over the summer. Her son Hugo is staying behind to finish his A levels and living with her sister Magda till June. She asked if I knew anyone up there", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "allotment", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "eleven years"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A levels", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till June", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t097-005", "text": "just off the phone w Sinead - flat viewing in Rathmines fell through, landlord pulled it. she's going to look again over the summer", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look again", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t097-006", "text": "Niamh mentioned her dog Rolo turns 5 on the 12th. she does a little cake for him every year lol. maybe get him a squeaky something", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 5", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "does a little cake for him every year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a squeaky something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t097-007", "text": "Lin is vegan now, strictly. Also really into bouldering, goes three times a week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes three times a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t097-008", "text": "So I bumped into Helen at the vet this morning and her rabbit Clover has been off his food since about Thursday. She thinks it might be his teeth again, he had the same thing last spring. They're doing bloods tomorrow morning and maybe an x-ray. Her husband's away with work so she's dealing with it all on her own. I should text her tomorrow afternoon to see what they found", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off his food", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since about Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last spring"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bloods", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "x-ray", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t097-009", "text": "Kiri got the keys!! completion was this morning. housewarming probably end of November 2026, she'll confirm", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of November 2026", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t097-011", "text": "Yusuf's daughter Ann starts at the new school in Bristol in January after they relocate. He said she's nervous about not knowing anyone, she's been at the same school since reception. They've booked a visit sometime next week so she can see the classroom. Their cat Simba is going to stay with Yusuf's mum until the house is sorted. Remind me to ask Yusuf how the school visit went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new school in Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocate", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since reception"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Simba", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the house is sorted"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Yusuf how the school visit went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t097-014", "text": "Yuki - allergic to cats, which is why she never comes round. remember that", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to cats", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t097-015", "text": "Mila's puppy Bao... no wait, the puppy is called Mochi, Bao is her flatmate. Anyway Mochi had his last jabs yesterday and can finally go out. Mila's taking him to the beach sometime next week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy is called Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last jabs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking him to the beach", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
