{"id": "t097-025", "text": "Claire mentioned Ciara's 30th is on 15 March 2027. Ciara's been dropping hints about a record player for months", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a record player", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}]}
{"id": "t097-027", "text": "Lindiwe is moving into her first place on her own! 1 bed in Walthamstow, top floor, no lift, keys on the 30th. she's a bit scared about doing it all alone, first time she's not lived with family or flatmates. Her dad wants to drive down from Leicester with the furniture but his back's bad. Must offer to help carry stuff, and maybe bring a plant for the flat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into her first place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "1 bed in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "top floor, no lift", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit scared", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "back's bad", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to help carry stuff", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring a plant for the flat", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t097-028", "text": "Shira's parrot Kiwi is 20 this year apparently. Older than her niece. She talks to him in Hebrew", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot Kiwi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "20 this year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "talks to him in Hebrew", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t097-029", "text": "Chris and his partner adopted two kittens from the rescue, Salt and Pepper. Their kids are obsessed", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "adopted", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two kittens from the rescue, Salt and Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "obsessed", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t097-032", "text": "moving day recap. Van came at 8, done by 2, only one box of plates broken which honestly is a win. The new place is colder than I expected, need to bleed the radiators. Still need to: change address with bank, register with a GP, find a dentist, sort the broadband which isn't live until the 3rd. Aim for sometime next week for all of that", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving day", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bleed the radiators", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "change address with bank", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "register with a GP", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find a dentist", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the broadband", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 3rd", "anchor": "a5"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t097-034", "text": "Dr Ahmed said the cat's thyroid levels are improving. next check early January 2027. Pepper's tablets twice a day with food", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "check", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a day"}]}
{"id": "t097-035", "text": "Called Mariam. The movers broke her grandmother's mirror. She's so upset. Insurance claim in by end of the month", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Insurance claim", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t097-040", "text": "Ming's dog Dumpling had his operation today, cruciate ligament, the one they'd been putting off since summer. Ming's taking the week off to look after him, he's got to be crated for six weeks which he will hate. She sounded exhausted, she was up at 4 with him. Should send her something, maybe a voucher for the dog place on Elm St", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Dumpling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since summer"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t097-041", "text": "todo this weekend. clear the loft, take old duvet to the tip, measure the bedroom for the wardrobe. then sunday: get the estate agent round for a valuation, they said any time end of the month is fine but I'd rather get it done. also need to decide on whether to keep the bookshelf or sell it, it won't fit in a one bed anyway", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "clear the loft", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take old duvet to the tip", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "measure the bedroom for the wardrobe", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sunday", "anchor": "a4"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the estate agent round for a valuation", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "estate agent"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "any time end of the month", "anchor": "a4"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "decide on whether to keep the bookshelf or sell it", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t097-043", "text": "Yuki moved to Osaka last month for her husband's job. Struggling a bit with the language. We should FaceTime soon, maybe end of next week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved to Osaka", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Struggling a bit with the language", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "FaceTime", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t097-045", "text": "So Julien rang, first week in Lyon done, he loves it. They've given him a team of six already which is mad for week one. Apartment's tiny though, basically a studio above a bakery, so he's looking for a bigger place in spring 2027 once probation is over. His girlfriend Yuki is joining him at Christmas. Said I should visit, maybe early March", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week in Lyon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "team of six", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "week one", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "tiny", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "studio above a bakery", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for a bigger place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in spring 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "once probation is over", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joining him", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t097-049", "text": "Kwame's brother Julien... sorry, Kwame's brother is called Kiri, not Julien. Kiri's getting married in Accra over Easter 2027. Whole family flying out for ten days, and Kwame's best man so he's writing the speech already. Alina's worried about flying that late in the pregnancy, she'll be about 7 months by then. They're going to ask the midwife at the next appointment", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Accra", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Easter 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnancy", "owner": "p6", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "p6", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t097-053", "text": "Ciara said Rohan's dad is home now and recovering, walking with a frame. Rohan's been staying with him most nights.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovering", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "walking with a frame", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most nights"}]}
{"id": "t097-055", "text": "Lindiwe said the move went fine and she's loving having her own space. Wants a cat eventually but the lease says no", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loving having her own space", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants a cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "eventually"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lease says no", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t097-056", "text": "Shira's landlord is selling, so she has to be out by end of February 2027. She's panicking a bit, rents in Manchester have gone mad and most places won't take a parrot. She's viewing two flats in Didsbury on Saturday and one in Levenshulme sometime next week. I should send her that listing I saw in Chorlton. Also ask her if Kiwi's cage fits in her mate Farid's spare room in the meantime", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "be out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing two flats in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one in Levenshulme", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that listing I saw in Chorlton", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her if Kiwi's cage fits in her mate Farid's spare room", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the meantime", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t097-058", "text": "Helen's rabbit Clover had a tooth abscess. On antibiotics, recheck in 10 days. she's ok, just tired from all the vet trips", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tooth abscess", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recheck", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 10 days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
